activity Apparatus Requisition
activity Requisition Authorize
activity Apparatus Purchase
activity Apparatus Accept
activity Apparatus Examine
activity up Apparatus Set
activity Personnel Educate
activity Apparatus Operate
activity Apparatus Service
activity Apparatus Retire
bind Apparatus Requisition: Identifier Requisition
bind Requisition Authorize: State Authorization
bind Apparatus Purchase: Price Apparatus
bind Apparatus Examine: State Apparatus, Rating Examination
bind Personnel Educate: Duration Instruction
bind up Apparatus Set: State Setup
bind Apparatus Service: State Servicing
bind Apparatus Retire: Cause Retire
bind Apparatus Operate: Rate Utilization
Identifier Requisition: integer between 1 and 10000
Price Apparatus: float between 100.0 and 100000.0
State Authorization: Pending, Approved, Rejected
State Apparatus: New, Good, Damaged
Duration Instruction: integer between 1 and 40
State Setup: Not Started, In Progress, Completed
State Servicing: Up to Date, Due, Overdue
Rate Utilization: integer between 0 and 100
Cause Retire: Obsolete, Faulty, Replaced
Rating Examination: float between 0.0 and 10.0
Init[Apparatus Requisition] | |
End[Apparatus Retire] | |
Existence[Apparatus Examine] | |
Absence[Apparatus Requisition] | |
Precedence[Apparatus Purchase, Requisition Authorize] | |A.State Authorization is Approved |
Chain Response[Apparatus Accept, Apparatus Examine] | | |0,2,d
Response[up Apparatus Set, Personnel Educate] |A.State Setup is Completed | |
Precedence[Apparatus Operate, Personnel Educate] | | |
Precedence[Apparatus Operate, Apparatus Service] | |T.State Servicing is Up to Date |
Not Chain Succession[Apparatus Operate, Apparatus Retire] | | |
Responded Existence[Apparatus Examine, Apparatus Retire] |A.State Apparatus is Damaged | |
Precedence[Apparatus Purchase, Requisition Authorize] |A.Price Apparatus > 1000 |T.State Authorization is Approved |
Chain Response[Apparatus Operate, Apparatus Service] | | |0,30,d
Precedence[up Apparatus Set, Apparatus Examine] | | |
Responded Existence[Apparatus Retire, Apparatus Examine] |A.Cause Retire is Obsolete | |